  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Log into VRC\n\n2. Go to any world with an active stream (club) or video player.\n\n3. Wait for first stream/video to complete or if you have control of the player, insert a new url/stream address.\n\n4. All screens go black or show default logos (ProTV)\n\n5. Rejoin world (still broke)\n\n6. Go to another world with player/stream running (still broke)\n\n7. Quit VRChat\n\n8. Restart VRChat\n\n9.  Goto #1\n\nI have tested this in the all current buids available to me.  I have verified files.  I have cleared my cache.  I have replaced the ytdl video exe in the appdata tools folder and tried that, then restored it with verify files.  Nothing seems to resolve this issue.  Please help, I'm unable to perform at venues currently as I need to quit and restart VRC between every DJ or song load.",
